<p>Predictions with a twist. This if kind of like 909, but more unsettling, and is different enough, IMO.</p>
<p>There was something similar to this in chat, and at first I thought it would be the idea proposed. However, the idea is completely different, but there are similar sections. Was this inspired by the 4 mile long arm?</p>
